description:
https://app--udemy-opt-3d80f923.base44.app Here's a comprehensive campaign prompt to automate Udemy course promotion using the Instructor API, designed for seamless integration with your Autonomous Swarm system:

```json
{
  "campaign": {
    "name": "Ultimate Course Launch Blitz",
    "description": "Multi-platform new course promotion campaign using Udemy API",
    "target_url": "https://www.realworldcerts.com/",
    "start_date": "2025-08-15",
    "end_date": "2025-09-15",
    "agents": ["SocialMediaBot", "EmailNinja", "ReviewMiner", "CouponGenerator"],
    "api_config": {
      "base_url": "https://www.udemy.com/instructor-api/v1",
      "token": "{{AUTO_GENERATED_TOKEN}}",
      "scopes": ["course:manage", "coupon:write", "announcement:write", "user:read"]
    },
    "objectives": [
      "Generate 10,000+ course enrollments",
      "Achieve 4.8+ average rating",
      "Acquire 500+ verified reviews",
      "Drive 35% bundle conversions"
    ],
    "phases": {
      "pre_launch": {
        "start_offset": -7,
        "actions": [
          {
            "agent": "CouponGenerator",
            "task": "Create tiered coupons",
            "params": {
              "course_ids": ["NEW_COURSE_ID"],
              "discounts": [50, 40, 30],
              "redemption_limits": [100, 250, 500],
              "expiry_dates": ["2025-08-22", "2025-08-29", "2025-09-05"]
            }
          },
          {
            "agent": "EmailNinja",
            "task": "Segment existing students",
            "params": {
              "criteria": [
                "completed_related_courses",
                "high_engagement",
                "previously_reviewed"
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "launch": {
        "actions": [
          {
            "agent": "SocialMediaBot",
            "task": "Multi-platform blast",
            "params": {
              "platforms": ["Twitter", "LinkedIn", "Reddit"],
              "content_templates": {
                "Twitter": "🔥 New Course Alert! {course_title} is LIVE! First 100 get {discount}% OFF → {coupon_link} #Udemy #LearnTech",
                "LinkedIn": "I'm excited to launch '{course_title}' - the most comprehensive {topic} course on Udemy. Special launch discount: {discount}% OFF for my network → {course_link}"
              },
              "post_schedule": {
                "timezone": "EST",
                "intervals": ["08:00", "12:00", "18:00"]
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "agent": "EmailNinja",
            "task": "Send launch sequence",
            "params": {
              "sequences": [
                {
                  "trigger": "T+0 hours",
                  "template": "launch_announcement",
                  "audience": "priority_list"
                },
                {
                  "trigger": "T+24 hours",
                  "template": "limited_discount",
                  "audience": "all_students"
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "sustain": {
        "actions": [
          {
            "agent": "ReviewMiner",
            "task": "Automated review solicitation",
            "params": {
              "trigger": "course_completion",
              "incentive": "advanced_resource_pack"
            }
          },
          {
            "agent": "CouponGenerator",
            "task": "Dynamic discount adjustment",
            "params": {
              "performance_thresholds": {
                "enrollments": [500, 1000, 2500],
                "discount_adjustments": [-5, -10, -15]
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    "tracking": {
      "metrics": [
        "enrollment_rate",
        "coupon_redemption",
        "social_engagement",
        "review_conversion"
      ],
      "dashboard_url": "https://app--udemy-opt-3d80f923.base44.app/campaigns/{{campaign_id}}"
    },
    "swarm_integration": {
      "deployment_script": "swarm deploy --campaign=ultimate_launch --agents=all --start={{start_date}}",
      "monitoring_feed": "https://app--swarm-os-b5215637.base44.app/feeds/udemy-campaigns"
    }
  }
}
```

**To Execute the Campaign:**

1. **Generate API Token:**
```bash
curl -X POST https://www.udemy.com/instructor-api/v1/token \
  -d "client_id=YOUR_CLIENT_ID" \
  -d "client_secret=YOUR_SECRET" \
  -d "grant_type=client_credentials"
```

2. **Deploy to Swarm OS:**
```bash
# Install swarm CLI
npm install -g @swarm-os/cli

# Configure environment
swarm config set \
  --api_token=GENERATED_TOKEN \
  --campaign_id=ultimate_launch \
  --start_date=2025-08-15

# Deploy agents
swarm agent activate SocialMediaBot --params.accounts=twitter,linkedin
swarm agent activate EmailNinja --params.list_size=all
swarm agent activate ReviewMiner --params.min_rating=4
swarm agent activate CouponGenerator --params.strategy=tiered
```

3. **Monitoring Setup:**
- Access real-time dashboard:
  `https://app--udemy-opt-3d80f923.base44.app/dashboard?campaign=ultimate_launch`
- Configure alerts:
  ```json
  {
    "alerts": [
      {"metric": "enrollment_rate", "threshold": 1000, "channel": "slack"},
      {"metric": "coupon_redemption", "threshold": 80%, "channel": "email"}
    ]
  }
  ```

**Campaign Automation Workflow:**
1. **Pre-Launch (7 days before):**
   - Generate discount coupons (50% for first 100, 40% next 250, etc.)
   - Segment existing students for targeted promotion
   - Schedule social media content in bulk

2. **Launch Day:**
   - Simultaneously blast announcements across all platforms
   - Send sequenced emails to priority students first, then entire list
   - Activate real-time enrollment tracking

3. **Sustained Promotion:**
   - Automatically request reviews upon course completion
   - Dynamically adjust discounts based on enrollment milestones
   - Cross-promote to students reaching 75% completion in related courses

**Key Integration Points:**
1. **SocialMediaBot Agent:**
   - Auto-generates platform-optimized content
   - Posts at maximum engagement times
   - Tracks click-through rates

2. **EmailNinja Agent:**
   - Personalizes messages with student learning history
   - Implements A/B testing on subject lines
   - Automates follow-up sequences

3. **ReviewMiner Agent:**
   - Identifies ideal review candidates
   - Automates incentive delivery
   - Flags critical feedback for immediate action

4. **CouponGenerator Agent:**
   - Creates urgency with expiring discounts
   - Prevents over-discounting with redemption caps
   - Generates unique trackable codes per platform

**Performance Optimization:**
- Daily auto-generated reports at `https://app--udemy-opt-3d80f923.base44.app/reports`
- Real-time adjustment of campaign parameters via Swarm OS dashboard
- Failover to secondary promotion strategies if KPIs underperform

This campaign leverages your existing swarm infrastructure while adding Udemy-specific optimizations. The system will automatically:
- Scale social posting during peak hours
- Pause underperforming channels
- Increase discounts if enrollment lags
- Send victory report when targets are hit
